the shape to the window. The angles are those Octave's view
takes for a plot: AZ turns anticlockwise about z, seen from
above, starting from the negative y axis, and EL rises from
the x-y plane, from -90 looking straight up to 90 looking
straight down. The z axis points up the window; looking
straight down or up, the y axis does, turned by AZ. The
