drafting: polymesh.Mesh
A triangle mesh in millimetres.

polymesh.Mesh holds a surface made of flat triangles: the points
of its vertices, the triangles as indices into them, and optionally a
colour for each vertex or each triangle. It is what
polymesh.read makes of an STL, OBJ or PLY file, what its method
write saves to one, and what solid.polyhedron builds a
solid from. A mesh from elsewhere, such as the faces and vertices
isosurface returns, becomes one through the constructor.

A mesh is measured by area, volume and bbox, moved
by translate, rotate, mirror and scale as a
solid.Shape is, and cut with a plane into regions by
section.

